74..148 Comment "// A port sort names a type of the theory\'s own source. A model in another"
149..223 Comment "// source reads the same type, or the model and the theory disagree on it."
224..226 Comment "//"
227..303 Comment "// The port of `say` names `Integer` in the declaring source, where it names"
304..383 Comment "// the strings. This source sees the prelude\'s `Integer`. The model still gives"
384..449 Comment "// a word, because the port reads the declaring source\'s binding."
